msgctxt "80"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "What happened? Was I right? Was I being stalked?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Nope. It was all a misunderstanding."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "I see... Thank you very..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Oh no, it's just... I still feel like somebody's\r\n"
"watching me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"But it's okay! I'm sure it's just my imagination running wild! Thank you so "
"much."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Here's for your trouble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "You got <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"(Can't help but still feel worried about her, but what else\r\n"
"can I do? I didn't find anyone who fit the bill.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Hi, Kiryu-san! What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"I was following a guy who looked pretty suspicious...\r\n"
"but I lost him. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Oh... Well, don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid ""
"Maybe I'm just imagining this whole \"stalker\" thing. And I\r\n"
"wouldn't want to waste any more of your time, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Take this for the trouble. Thank you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "You got <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"(I'm still a little worried about her, but if\r\n"
"she says she's okay, I'll leave it at that.)"
msgstr ""

